ivery.\"\n  ],\n  \"native_bridge_status\": \"NOT_DERIVED\",\n  \"next_native_obligation\": \"Provide a producing operation and immutable source that make at least one fixed separating effect available to the same retained owner, identifying the complete typed source-only chain without assuming the delivery it seeks to prove.\"\n}",
